        (hqEnergyMoment 12) (hqLocationMoment c 12)) +
      √(Dpap 13138 (splitRemovedBudget c) hqCentreCap (locationVarianceBudget c)
        scaleVarianceBudget eta rowSigma) ≤ _
  linarith

